{"api_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37921","collected_at":"2026-09-27T21:56:43.523155+00:00","comments":[{"author_association":"COLLABORATOR","body":"Hi - thanks for the report. This is working as intended – in general `jax.numpy` avoids promoting everything to 64-bit as NumPy does, because 64-bit values often come with performance penalties on accelerators.","created_at":"2026-05-22T13:21:43Z","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/37921#issuecomment-4519046078","id":4519046078,"issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37921","minimized":null,"node_id":"IC_kwDOCTkjjc8AAAABDVsrvg","performed_via_github_app":null,"pin":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/4519046078/reactions"},"updated_at":"2026-05-22T13:21:43Z","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/comments/4519046078","user":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}}],"issue":{"active_lock_reason":null,"assignee":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"},"assignees":[{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"}],"author_association":"NONE","body":"### Description\n\n\n`jnp.searchsorted` always returns an `int32` index array, even when `jax_enable_x64=True` is set. NumPy's `np.searchsorted` always returns `int64` on a 64-bit platform. The values are correct; the dtype is wrong.\n\n```python\nimport jax\njax.config.update(\"jax_enable_x64\", True)\n\nimport jax.numpy as jnp\nimport numpy as np\n\na    = np.array([1, 3, 5, 7, 9, 11], dtype=np.int32)\nvals = np.array([1, 5, 11],          dtype=np.int32)\n\nnp_out  = np.searchsorted(a, vals)\njnp_out = jnp.searchsorted(jnp.array(a), jnp.array(vals))\n\nprint(np_out,  np_out.dtype)                     # [0 2 5]  int64  ← correct\nprint(np.asarray(jnp_out), jnp_out.dtype)        # [0 2 5]  int32  ← BUG\n```\n\nThe bug affects every supported input dtype — the x64 flag makes no difference:\n\n```\nx32 mode (jax_enable_x64=False): jnp.searchsorted → int32\nx64 mode (jax_enable_x64=True):  jnp.searchsorted → int32  ← should be int64\nnumpy (same platform):            np.searchsorted  → int64\n```\n\nOther index-returning operations (`jnp.argmax`, `jnp.argmin`, `jnp.argsort`, `jnp.nonzero`) all correctly return `int64` under x64 mode, so the bug is localised to `jnp.searchsorted`'s implementation. It appears `searchsorted` hardcodes `int32` as the output type and was not updated when the other index operations were fixed.\n\nThis can cause silent downstream dtype mismatches and, on very large arrays (> 2 billion elements), silent index overflow/wrap rather than a visible error.\n\nA workaround until fixed:\n\n```python\nindices = jnp.searchsorted(a, vals).astype(np.int64 if jax.config.jax_enable_x64 else np.int32)\n```\n\n### System info (python version, jaxlib version, accelerator, etc.)\n\n\n```\nJAX version:    0.10.1.dev20260513+64f6e229b\njaxlib version: (matching dev build)\nNumPy version:  2.4.4\nPython:         3.12.13\nPlatform:       macOS arm64\nAccelerator:    CPU\n```\n","closed_at":"2026-05-22T13:21:43Z","closed_by":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/781659?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/jakevdp","id":781659,"login":"jakevdp","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc4MTY1OQ==","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/jakevdp","user_view_type":"public"},"comments":1,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37921/comments","created_at":"2026-05-22T02:37:41Z","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37921/events","html_url":"https://github.com/jax-ml/jax/issues/37921","id":4499361932,"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"total_blocking":0},"issue_field_values":[],"labels":[{"archived_at":null,"archived_by":null,"color":"d73a4a","default":true,"description":"Something isn't working","id":1104782284,"name":"bug","node_id":"MDU6TGFiZWwxMTA0NzgyMjg0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/labels/bug"}],"labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37921/labels{/name}","locked":false,"milestone":null,"node_id":"I_kwDOCTkjjc8AAAABDC7QjA","number":37921,"performed_via_github_app":null,"pinned_comment":null,"reactions":{"+1":0,"-1":0,"confused":0,"eyes":0,"heart":0,"hooray":0,"laugh":0,"rocket":0,"total_count":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issues/37921/reactions"},"repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax","state":"closed","state_reason":"completed","sub_issues_summary":{"completed":0,"percent_completed":0,"total":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/jax-ml/jax/issu